   "widgets_values": [
    "## Model Links\n\n- [Hugging Face: Comfy-Org/Idol](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Idol) (TripoSplat fine-tune)\n- [Hugging Face:Comfy-Org/BiRefNet](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/BiRefNet)\n- Original: [VAST-AI-Research/TripoSplat](https://github.com/VAST-AI-Research/TripoSplat)\n\nWeights: `diffusion_models/idol_fp16`, `vae/idol_decoder_fp16`, `clip_vision/dino_v3_vit_h_bf16`,\n`vae/flux2-vae`, `background_removal/birefnet`"
